    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eFix-mas\u300f is a top-view action game centered on Just Avoidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a toy with Chris, the fairy of the Christmas gift factory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a screw over the enemy's head with magic bullets and accurate evasion, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rush it in and throw it in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >not in-game english supported!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairy &quot;Chris&quot; to fix the toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas Eve, misassembled toys started going crazy! Fairy Chris goes out to solve the mess with a screwdriver.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cracking a toy with a screw</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat an enemy, you must first fire a magic bullet with a screwdriver to create a screw over your enemy's head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And rush towards the enemy and screw in the screw you've made!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evading enemy attacks in a timely manner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the enemy evades in time for an attack, bonus bullets fly away! Bonus bullets instantly create a single screw over the enemy's head.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fixing Broken Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've broken the toy, now it's time to fix it again and wrap it up pretty!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eFix-mas\u300f is a top-view action game centered on Just Avoidance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix a toy with Chris, the fairy of the Christmas gift factory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a screw over the enemy's head with magic bullets and accurate evasion, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >rush it in and throw it in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >not in-game english supported!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairy &quot;Chris&quot; to fix the toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On Christmas Eve, misassembled toys started going crazy! Fairy Chris goes out to solve the mess with a screwdriver.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cracking a toy with a screw</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To defeat an enemy, you must first fire a magic bullet with a screwdriver to create a screw over your enemy's head!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And rush towards the enemy and screw in the screw you've made!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Evading enemy attacks in a timely manner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the enemy evades in time for an attack, bonus bullets fly away! Bonus bullets instantly create a single screw over the enemy's head.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fixing Broken Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you've broken the toy, now it's time to fix it again and wrap it up pretty!</p>",
